-- ======================================================
-- SECTION 9: BUSINESS SAFEGUARDS
-- ======================================================

-- 1. Customer geography is based on geographic
--    reference matching for customer ZIP prefixes.
-- 2. The state chart uses customer-state attributes.
-- 3. It is not a map of exact customer addresses.
-- 4. Map-ready means eligible geographic references.
-- 5. Flagged coordinates remain visible as exceptions.
-- 6. Orders, Items, Payments and Reviews have
--    different record grains.
-- 7. Their completeness percentages use their
--    corresponding fact-record denominators.
-- 8. Purchase Date defines the order-purchase cohort.
-- 9. Seller dimension measures do not automatically
--    respond to order Purchase Date or Status.
-- 10. Geo Fact Type remains disconnected.
-- 11. The state ranking chart does not need
--    Azure Maps or any Power BI cloud service.
-- 12. Do not remove source records during reporting.


